    <data key="d0">Krmong Automated Security Event Management and Remediation Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uMX94Mn9u-4</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture designed for automated security event detection, aggregation, visualization, and remediation using AWS security services.</data>
